stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: meeting retained, preparation requested
    Pending --> Disposed: no possible deals
    Pending --> Active: possible deals found
    Pending --> Failed: savepoint cannot start
    Active --> Ready: read, projection and release succeed
    Active --> Partial: possible deal absent, release succeeds
    Active --> Recovery: read, projection or release fails
    Recovery --> Unavailable: rollback and release succeed
    Recovery --> Failed: transaction recovery fails
    Ready --> Disposed: return meeting
    Partial --> Disposed: return meeting
    Unavailable --> Disposed: return meeting with safe note
    Failed --> [*]: propagate unrecoverable failure
    Disposed --> [*]: caller continues
    note right of Pending
      Authorization retirement is n/a here.
      The existing caller authorizes before projection.
      Nontransactional calls follow the same states without savepoint SQL.
    end note
    %% never roll back a released preparation savepoint
    %% never retain ready preparation after a contained projection failure

    [*] --> Observing: proof requested
    Observing --> ReceiptReady: observation succeeds
    Observing --> ReceiptContradiction: observation contradicts acceptance
    Observing --> ReceiptUnavailable: wrapper or total deadline expires
    ReceiptReady --> ReceiptEmitted: disarm deadline, emit success
    ReceiptContradiction --> ReceiptEmitted: disarm deadline, emit contradiction
    ReceiptUnavailable --> ReceiptEmitted: disarm deadline, emit unavailable
    ReceiptEmitted --> [*]: exit with matching status
    %% never interrupt a completed observation's receipt with its deadline
